      "extract": "The World Health Organization (WHO) is grateful for the contributions of many individuals across different organizations. This digital adaptation kit was coordinated by Maria Barreix; Tigest Tamrat and Özge Tunçalp of the WHO Department of Sexual and Reproductive Health and Research (SRH); Garrett Mehl and Natschja Ratanaprayul of the WHO Department of Digital Health and Innovations (DHI). WHO is grateful to the",
